# Used by Posit Connect Cloud (and rsconnect's writeManifest()/deployApp())
# to decide which files in this repo belong to a given deployment, both
# for bundling AND for R-package dependency scanning. This repo holds two
# separate, unrelated Connect Cloud deployments:
#   - shiny_app/app.R          -> the IM Monitoring Shiny dashboard
#   - run_workflow.qmd (root)  -> the scheduled data pipeline
# Without this file, publishing run_workflow.qmd fails with
# "This content is missing the following dependencies: shiny" because the
# dependency scanner walks the whole repo and picks up shiny_app/app.R's
# library(shiny) call even though the pipeline itself never uses shiny.
# These directories are irrelevant to the pipeline and safe to exclude
# from ITS deployment entirely (shiny_app/ has its own manifest.json and
# is unaffected by this file, since its bundle root is shiny_app/ itself).
shiny_app/
_archive/
Claude outputs/
AFRO_Independant_Monitoring_data_workflow/
